<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Healthcare raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Healthcare raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it raised United HealthCare Corp to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- raised the earnings estimate to $2.37 per share from $2.35 for 1997, and to $2.95 from $2.83 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/8 to 51-1/2.</p>
</text>
